# A113 T1 -- k0_00 cells vs distance to the k >= 1 manifold

eta = max(L-inf position distance to the nearest of the 36 corner-lattice cell centres, sqrt(2) sin(tilt-gap/2)); tilt gap = distance of the cell's theta interval to 0 mod 90.


